  <blockquote>
    Hey everyone, 
Place Version History is now available for everyone! Before you jump in, we have created a new workflow that’s important to understand, so check out the steps below! 

Open up Place Version History 
1a. At the time of this writing, use Game Explorer, Asset Manager, or Game Settings to open up Place Version History.

(Game Explorer) 
[image] 
(Asset Manager) 
 <a class="lightbox" href="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/4X/9/0/b/90b83e5a201fd15909f7f72890ae2b47498c0704.png" data-download-href="/uploads/short-url/kEfuJGPxElaAYMO9pGZZRwaFFlO.png?dl=1" title="image" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">[image]</a> 
(Game Settings) 
 <a class="lightbox" href="//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/4X/3/d/b/3dbf8f8db86abc9613bba26f690ca8fb22153ed1.png" data-download-href="/uploads/short-url/8OfxEevVlS83mN9rLKxRFqhv8gV.png?dl=1" title="image" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">[image]</a> 
